{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/bridge/src/parts/test.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-19T07:53:37.157447Z","id":"e6c9937e9689745a797eab23ced6db5529eac985e2cd063cc84f772d570a88ec","body":{"detail":"Failure: clax.browser.test({path: \"docs/guide.html\"}, {tests: true}) on a draft holding docs/guide.html and tests/a.test.js answers tests.failed [{name: \"tests/a.test.js\", error: \"the file did not load: ...\"}] and passed: false; the same happens when a goto step moved to docs/guide.html before the tests ran.\nPages::test_files (crates/clax-bot/src/browser/serve.rs:124-139) returns artifact-relative paths (\"tests/a.test.js\"), saved_tests_js (crates/clax-bot/src/browser/session.rs:230-235) passes them unchanged to window.claxTest.run, run here hands them to runTests, and runTests loads each as new URL(file, win.location.href) (web/bridge/src/harness.ts:256). On https://<artifact ID>.clax-test.invalid/docs/guide.html that is /docs/tests/a.test.js, which Site::answer serves as 404. A name holding `?` or `#` (is_test_file in crates/clax-bot/src/browser/opts.rs allows both) is cut at it by the same resolution.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":12},"end":{"line":15},"content_hash":"12d30bd5243f7c82aa3a684f1702d7d229a8f63f890f2503fcff8b9d0544decb"},"suggested_fix":"Have the driver send root-absolute, percent-encoded URLs: in saved_tests_js map each path to \"/\" + its segments each encodeURIComponent-style escaped (e.g. with url::Url::join on the Origin, or Origin::url), so runTests's new URL(file, location.href) lands on the artifact's file wherever the page is; add a session test with a target path in a subdirectory and a bridge test that a root-absolute file loads.","summary":"Saved tests resolve against the page's own URL, so a browser test of a page outside the root (or after a goto step) loads tests/<name>.test.js from the wrong directory and every file fails to load","tags":["review","review:browser-phase1","session:claude-code:45f8f414-5fc7-4063-9013-583e3e7b95ea"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/bridge/src/parts/test.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:26.314416Z","id":"f161aa2699316fc51076fa400aa1c4c08110cd1fb68fa32fe3f18018fdf84f25","body":{"detail":"At 8f4a76898: Pages::test_files (crates/clax-bot/src/browser/serve.rs 124-139) returns paths matching is_test_file (crates/clax-bot/src/browser/opts.rs 648-652: 'tests/<name>.test.js', artifact-relative); saved_tests_js (crates/clax-bot/src/browser/session.rs 230-235) passes them unchanged; run in web/bridge/src/parts/test.ts 14-15 hands them to runTests, which loads `new URL(file, win.location.href)` (web/bridge/src/harness.ts 256). For a page at https://<host>/docs/guide.html that is /docs/tests/a.test.js; Site::file (serve.rs 296-311) looks up 'docs/tests/a.test.js' and answers 404, so the file fails to load. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-19-claxbot-browser-design.md section 7.1 puts tests at tests/<name>.test.js of the artifact. Concrete Failure given; blocker stands.","kind":"comment","references":"e6c9937e9689745a797eab23ced6db5529eac985e2cd063cc84f772d570a88ec","summary":"confirmed: artifact-relative test paths are resolved against the page's URL","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:45f8f414-5fc7-4063-9013-583e3e7b95ea"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/bridge/src/parts/test.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:25.472026Z","id":"a5e56235aeafbbb4a7066fe0718cf3869020e41f2a0aec84463f038553e99fe9","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:515a02257","summary":"Fixed in 515a02257: window.claxTest.run resolves the files against the site's root (runTests's new base option); web/bridge/test/harness.test.ts 'loads files from the base it is given, not the page's directory' passes in //web:unit. bazel test //crates/clax-bot/... //crates/clax-store/... //crates/clax-server/... //crates/clax-cli/... //bazel/wasm:check //web:unit //web:lint //web:typecheck //web:bundle_size: 33 tests pass (run at 835edf396; //crates/clax-bot/... passes again after the rustfmt commit da686e589).","supersedes":"e6c9937e9689745a797eab23ced6db5529eac985e2cd063cc84f772d570a88ec","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:45f8f414-5fc7-4063-9013-583e3e7b95ea"]}}
